 *   MCP3008 DOUT -> GPIO9  (SPI0 MISO)
 *   MCP3008 DIN  -> GPIO10 (SPI0 MOSI)
 *   MCP3008 CS   -> GPIO8  (SPI0 CE0)
 *   MCP3008 CH0  -> SpiroQuant A+ analog output
 *
 * Build:  gcc -O2 -Wall -Wextra -o spiroquant spiroquant.c -lpigpio -lrt
 * Run:    sudo ./spiroquant
