 *
 * Reads a Vegetronix VH400 soil moisture sensor on channel 0 of an MCP3008
 * ADC on SPI0 (CE0, GPIO 8, 1 MHz, mode 0), compares the reading to a
 * configurable threshold, and activates a relay-driven water pump on GPIO
 * 18 (BCM) for a configurable duration.
 *
