 * Wiring:
 *   MLX75030 VDD  -> 3.3 V (pin 1)
 *   MLX75030 GND  -> GND  (pin 6)
 *   MLX75030 SDA  -> GPIO2 / I2C1 SDA (pin 3)
 *   MLX75030 SCL  -> GPIO3 / I2C1 SCL (pin 5)
