/*
 * SHT40 Humidity & Temperature Logger for Raspberry Pi 3 Model B+
 * Uses pigpio for I2C communication.
 *
 * Wiring:
 *   SHT40 SDA -> GPIO2 (BCM)
 *   SHT40 SCL -> GPIO3 (BCM)
 *   SHT40 VDD -> 3.3V
