/*
 * Raspberry Pi 5 – YL-83 rain sensor monitor with L298N motor driver
 *
 * Wiring:
 *   YL-83 OUT  -> GPIO17 (active-low)
 *   YL-83 VCC  -> 3.3 V
 *   YL-83 GND  -> GND
 *   L298N IN1  -> GPIO22 (ENA)
 *   L298N IN2  -> GPIO23 (M1)
 *   L298N IN3  -> GPIO24 (M2)
 *   L298N EN   -> GPIO20 (ENA)
 *   L298N IN4  -> GPIO21 (M1)
 *   L298N IN5  -> GPIO22 (M2)
 *   L298N IN6  -> GPIO23 (M1)
 *   L298N IN7  -> GPIO24 (M2)
 *
