 * Hardware:
 *   - Two MLX90217 sensors on the GPIO bus (BCM numbers)
 *   - Sensor A: GPIO17 (edge-triggered alert)
 *   - Sensor B: GPIO27 (edge-triggered alert)
 *   - Hardware pull-up resistors on the sensors' SDA/SCL lines
 *   - Sensor A: 90° electrical offset
